WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.163
A notification identifies the press
and the measurement that is drifting.

00:00:04.163 --> 00:00:05.629
This is a simulated alert.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.115
Open the alert and acknowledge it.

00:00:08.115 --> 00:00:11.900
The operator decides whether the press
should keep running during the checks.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:16.635
VP Expert lists the checks to
make next. Their order is a guide,

00:00:16.635 --> 00:00:18.052
not proof of a cause.
